		</rules>
		<scenario>
			<name>Reinstated with Full Honours... and DEBT!</name>
			<summary>A crew of three Star Federation officers, burdened by a massive Bogleg loan.</summary>
			<description>Captain Crash Gunderson had his ship hijacked by band of notorious space pirates, and with it his captaincy with the Star Federation was recinded until he had a vessel again under his command.

After some illicit deals, and questionable backroom acts with the Bogleg Cartel, his beautiful ship was returned to him, having been purchased from a charismatic pirate in a purple top hat.

With his ship returned to him, so was his rank and official status as a Captain of the Star Federation, but what they don't know is Crash Gunderson took on a substantial debt of one-million space dollars to be repaid, with interest, yearly, otherwise the Bogleg cartel would be back for their property.</description>
			<playerFaction>
				<def>PlayerFaction</def>
				<factionDef>GravshipCrew</factionDef>
			</playerFaction>
			<surfaceLayer>
				<def>SurfaceLayerFixed</def>
				<layer>Surface</layer>
				<settingsDef>Surface</settingsDef>
