				<li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
					<def>GameStartDialog</def>
					<text>The gravship is yours, but the debt weighs heavy. You've landed on the surface, ready to gather resources and make your payments. Remember your payments!

To launch the gravship, select the pilot console, then select the launch command.

On the world map, select ‘view planet' to choose a landing spot on the planet.</text>
