		<history>
			<archive>
				<archivables>
					<li Class="ArchivedDialog">
						<text>The gravship is yours, but the debt weighs heavy. You've landed on the surface, ready to gather resources and make your payments. Remember your payments!

To launch the gravship, select the pilot console, then select the launch command.

On the world map, select ‘view planet' to choose a landing spot on the planet.</text>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>1</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Global Threat: Low</label>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>1</arrivalTick>
						<text>Hostile forces currently poses a low nearby threat (0.00 offensive strength within Influence Radius).

Nearby offensive strength:
---------------------------------------------
Hypermedia: 0
Ludmila Complex: 0
The Ikwa Bats: 0
The Fallen Imperium: 0</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="Message">
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<ID>10</ID>
						<text>Cpt. Gunderson has been assigned the rank of Captain.</text>
						<startingTime>10406.5195</startingTime>
						<startingFrame>1621051</startingFrame>
						<startingTick>6</startingTick>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human1117</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<quest>null</quest>
					</li>
					<li Class="Message">
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<ID>11</ID>
						<text>Lt. Jornker has been assigned the rank of Lieutenant Commander.</text>
						<startingTime>-99999</startingTime>
						<startingFrame>1622262</startingFrame>
						<startingTick>6</startingTick>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human1134</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<quest>null</quest>
					</li>
					<li Class="Message">
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<ID>12</ID>
						<text>Ens. Noodle has been assigned the rank of Ensign.</text>
						<startingTime>-99999</startingTime>
						<startingFrame>1623201</startingFrame>
						<startingTick>6</startingTick>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human1124</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<quest>null</quest>
					</li>
					<li Class="Message">
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<ID>20</ID>
						<text>Customization saved for selected Brain In a Jar(s).</text>
						<startingTime>12286.2021</startingTime>
						<startingFrame>1914705</startingFrame>
						<startingTick>48</startingTick>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<quest>null</quest>
					</li>
					<li Class="Message">
						<def>SilentInput</def>
						<ID>24</ID>
						<text>The quiet around &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ens. Noodle&lt;/color&gt; is chosen, not imposed. Beneath the clear of Permanent summer. She prefers it.</text>
						<startingTime>13946.2939</startingTime>
						<startingFrame>2178265</startingFrame>
						<startingTick>316</startingTick>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human1124</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<quest>null</quest>
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>3</ID>
						<def>NegativeEvent</def>
						<label>Hostile: United Senseans</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>null</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>Faction_11</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>1000</arrivalTick>
						<text>Relations with (*Faction=Faction_11)United Senseans(/Faction) have broken down completely. They are now hostile to you.

They will conduct periodic raids on your colony and caravans, and refuse to trade with you. If you want to improve relations, you can still offer them gifts using caravans or transport pods.

This happened because goodwill (-100) has fallen below -75. In order to restore neutral relations, goodwill must reach 0 again.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>4</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Ens. Noodle — Something that cannot be handled alone</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human1124</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3378</arrivalTick>
						<text>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ens. Noodle&lt;/color&gt; has managed without help for long enough that asking has become structural.

But this problem does not fit the usual approach.

She considers her options, during the quiet hour after the last meal but before sleep. There are fewer than she would like.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>5</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Primary ideoligion changed</label>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3378</arrivalTick>
						<text>Your faction's primary ideoligion has changed from (*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo) to (*Ideo=Ideo_8)The Cult(/Ideo).

This happened because (*Ideo=Ideo_8)The Cult(/Ideo) is now more common among your colonists than any other ideoligion.

Your primary ideoligion affects relationships with other factions, based on how closely your beliefs align with theirs.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>6</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Primary ideoligion changed</label>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3378</arrivalTick>
						<text>Your faction's primary ideoligion has changed from (*Ideo=Ideo_8)The Cult(/Ideo) to (*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo).

This happened because (*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo) is now more common among your colonists than any other ideoligion.

Your primary ideoligion affects relationships with other factions, based on how closely your beliefs align with theirs.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>7</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>(*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo) rituals activated</label>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3378</arrivalTick>
						<text>Since (*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo) is now the primary ideoligion of your faction, Crews will demand that the rituals of (*Ideo=Ideo_7)Good Ship Cirrus(/Ideo) be carried out.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>8</ID>
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<label>Enemy now neutral: United Senseans</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>null</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>Faction_11</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3450</arrivalTick>
						<text>Relations with (*Faction=Faction_11)United Senseans(/Faction) have warmed. They now consider you neutral and will no longer attack you.

This happened because goodwill (0) has risen past 0. If goodwill falls below -75, (*Faction=Faction_11)United Senseans(/Faction) will become hostile again. If goodwill rises above +75, they will become your ally and fight for you.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
