						<description>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. Humans are the device-makers, and the archotechs are their devices. In the end, the archotechs will depart. Only those who are sufficiently augmented will be allowed to go with them.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. Humans are the device-makers, and the archotechs are their devices. In the end, the archotechs will depart. Only those who are sufficiently augmented will be allowed to go with them.</descriptionTemplate>
