						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Oubanyen</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Hiseunos</name>
									<type>Creator of Family</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Collectivist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
								<li>
									<name>Uneuteus</name>
									<type>Goddess of Creation</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_TheistEmbodied</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>The Cult</name>
						<adjective>unitary</adjective>
						<memberName>Unitist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Gun</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Gun</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen, both Unitists and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Hiseunos&lt;/color&gt;. A tree-harvester arose and threatened to destroy &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Hiseunos&lt;/color&gt; himself using an archotech mass-inverter. A hunter named Vana Metric threw herself into a fire to protest the tree-harvester, but the Unitists pulled her out and made her their leader because of her devotion to the group. Metric gathered the Unitists in a shaman cave and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Hiseunos&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen, both %%memberNamePlural%% and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of %%deity0_name%%. A tree-harvester arose and threatened to destroy %%deity0_name%% %%deity0_objective%%self using an archotech mass-inverter. A hunter named Vana Metric threw herself into a fire to protest the tree-harvester, but the %%memberNamePlural%% pulled her out and made her their leader because of her devotion to the group. Metric gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a shaman cave and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Benefactor</culture>
