						</foundation>
						<name>Good Ship Cirrus</name>
						<adjective>Crewman</adjective>
						<memberName>Crew</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Captain</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Captain</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Cpt. Crash Gunderson, of the good ship Cirrus, has his own unique system of command - a happy crew is a successful crew.

Unfortunately the Democratic Order of Planets don't tend to agree with his style of leadership, and the Cirrus is frequently assigned crew from the bottom of the space barrel.

And yet, despite the Cirrus being given the most dangerous, high-risk, death-defying missions, they always seem to come out on top, emboldening the ego of the captain, and stranding the admirals on planet Disbelief.</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>CirclesB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>kathanon_CraftWithColor_8775423</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_Authoritarianism</li>
							<li>Shipborn</li>
							<li>QuesterMeme_QuesterMeme</li>
							<li>VME_PartyLife</li>
							<li>Seti_Militarism</li>
						</memes>
