							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Gailas</name>
									<type>Goddess of Creation</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_TheistAbstract</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Celestial Faith</name>
						<adjective>Gailasic</adjective>
						<memberName>Gailasist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Pilot</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Pilot</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the days of darkness, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gailas&lt;/color&gt; saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded her Gailasists to build great ships. A group of kharockian scientist arose under a terrible head-director. They trapped the Gailasists in a single training grounds. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gailas&lt;/color&gt; came to the science officer Jem Drake as a beggar, and spoke to her about life. Drake sacrificed herself to personally kill the head-director.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the days of darkness, %%deity0_name%% saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded %%deity0_possessive%% %%memberNamePlural%% to build great ships. A group of kharockian scientist arose under a terrible head-director. They trapped the %%memberNamePlural%% in a single training grounds. %%Deity0_name%% came to the science officer Jem Drake as a beggar, and spoke to her about life. Drake sacrificed herself to personally kill the head-director.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>Ideoligion_StarWarsA</iconDef>
