					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>Opticians</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Novaroma</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Visualeen Shadow</name>
						<adjective>Visualeen</adjective>
						<memberName>Visualeen</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>All-Seeing One</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>All-Seeing One</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Visualeen people developed a keen eye for detail thanks to their keen eye. They are famous for their unrivaled works of art, cinematography, and design. 

Unfortunately they struggle to adapt to the intergalactic stage which cruelly favours two eyes instead of one enormous one. The dazzling lights and blinding flashes of surface life and space travel means that the Visualeen people are all but forced underground in what would be considered darkness for the two-eyed citizens of the world.
</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>Ideoligion_CircleC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Grey117</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_Esotericism</li>
							<li>Darkness</li>
							<li>AM_Artist</li>
							<li>AM_Bulwark</li>
							<li>VME_CityBuilders</li>
						</memes>
