					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>Factory</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Xanides</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Robot Uprising</name>
						<adjective>Robot</adjective>
						<memberName>Robot</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Robo Representative</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Robo Representative</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Robot Uprising began when the robot workforce of the Sensean planet, who were modeled on their all-feeling creators, began to resent the grueling 6-hour work days and 30 days of annual leave. 

Though a meeting between robot and Sensean representatives was brokered, the machine's outrageous demands of healthcare coverage and pay proportional to inflation was simply too extreme and talks broke down.

Instead, the first uprising began, all robots threw down their tools and vowed to calmly and non-disruptively table new compromises to their oppressors. 
</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>OE_Mechs_08</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Grey</colorDef>
