						<id>44</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>The Iron Glove</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Xanides</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Grabulon Creed</name>
						<adjective>Grabulon</adjective>
						<memberName>Grabulon</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>The Turgid One</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>The Turgid One</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Through no fault of their own, the Grabulons were ostracised and isolated by the other Senseans, as where the others could communicate and interpret from a distance, the Grabulons required closer contact, overwhelming their fellow planetary denizens.

As a result, many of the Grabulons used their natural dexterity and fine motor function to industrialise and take what they needed to survive by force from the other Senseans who had driven them away.

The Grabulon's are almost exclusively found as pirates and marauders, and have a knack for skilled labour, but there have been more than a few occasions where Grabulons and Liplickers have been seen fraternising for whatever disgusting reasons.
</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>Stellaris_Aquatic04</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Orange14</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>AM_Structure_Corsair</li>
							<li>MI_Industrialist</li>
							<li>RS_LoveLusting</li>
							<li>VME_HardcoreIndustrialism</li>
							<li>VME_CraftCulture</li>
							<li>VFEA_Isolationist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>pollution</name>
								<def>MI_Pollution_Preferred</def>
								<ID>5084</ID>
								<randomSeed>-2014586006</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>toxic waste dumping</name>
								<def>MI_ToxicWasteDumping_Respected</def>
								<ID>5085</ID>
								<randomSeed>-121471840</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>being recruited</name>
								<def>VFEA_BeingRecruited_Forbidden</def>
								<ID>5086</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1641034045</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
