						<name>Snifflax Conservators</name>
						<adjective>Snifflax</adjective>
						<memberName>Snifflax</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>The Scent-Catcher</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>The Scent-Catcher</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Snifflax people are hyper-sensitive to pollutants, foul-odours, and the stench of decay - be it natural or through battle.

 As a result, their culture became one of peace, harmony, and cultivation of nature, with a strong distain of violence and especially those that would bring death to the green groves of their capital city of Snifflax.

The Snifflax people frequently find themselves at odds with the Liplickers as their bodily pleasures, both culinary and carnal, are overwhelming to the Snifflax people.</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>OE_Icons_22</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightGreen</colorDef>
