					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>Gastronarium</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Nuchadus</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Holy Council of Liplicker</name>
						<adjective>Liplicker</adjective>
						<memberName>Liplicker</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Cardinal</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Cardinal</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Liplicker people are obsessed with anything remotely pleasurable going in, and around, their humongous, distended mouths.

They make for chefs of galaxy-wide renown, and many of the richest luxury space yachts will clamour to get a Liplicker in the kitchen. 

On their home planet the real extremes of their depravity can be uncovered, seeking to blend pleasure of all forms.
</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>OE_Modules_17</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Pink</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_Bacchanalianism</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
							<li>AM_Epicurean</li>
							<li>MI_Faith</li>
							<li>RS_LoveLusting</li>
							<li>VME_SweetTeeth</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>research</name>
								<def>Research_ExtremelySlow</def>
								<ID>5372</ID>
								<randomSeed>634618085</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>funeral (no corpse)</name>
								<def>AM_FuneralNoCorpse</def>
