					<li>
						<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>Auditorium</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>SSb_Place_AlphaTarascon</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Audacian Listeners</name>
						<adjective>Audacians</adjective>
						<memberName>Audacians</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Listener</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Listener</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Audacians lacked the finer, well-tuned senses of their planetary cousins and instead relied on their emotional capacity to listen as well as possible, and it was possible they could listen well, on account of being enormous ears.

Audacians will frequently act as diplomats, emissaries, and envoys on the galactic stage, but they shy away from the packed Glitterworlds and especially avoid combat by any means necessary.

The Audacians tend to keep their distance from the Liplickers as the volume tends to be deafening.</description>
						<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>oracle_Ideoligion_StellarMother</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Maritime51</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>AM_Monastic</li>
							<li>MI_Empiricist</li>
							<li>Altruism</li>
