								<title>Something that cannot be handled alone</title>
								<body>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ens. Noodle&lt;/color&gt; has managed without help for long enough that asking has become structural.

But this problem does not fit the usual approach.

She considers her options, during the quiet hour after the last meal but before sleep. There are fewer than she would like.</body>
